    {
      "text": "Fig 12, 'SCISMM maturity levels for HSCISs'. Five levels of the supply chain information system maturity model, each with its characteristics and an example: level 1 reporting-based (manual, paper or stand-alone tools), level 2 transactional (siloed), level 3 advanced digitalization (integrated), level 4 end-to-end visibility (exchanged) and level 5 digital ecosystem (collaborated). Reproduced by permission from Digital Square.",
